    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27003" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lōrīcŭla</span></b> ,
		ae, f.
		dim.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				small breastplate;</i> hence, transf., <i>a small
				breastwork</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quorum frontes viminea loricula munirentur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hirt. B. G. 8, 9, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">loricula urbem esse circumdatam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Veg. Mil. 4, 28</span></i>
			.</div>
